      "text": "Three collaboration modes are offered: Auto (end-to-end execution), Loop (editable `goal+plan.md` advanced through plan, execute, verify, iterate ticks), and Design (faithful execution of a user-written plan); autonomy and permission levels are independent of mode."
    },
