      ],
      "text": "Persistent state lives in typed documents (knowledge, strategy, methodology, skill, memory, design, worklog, diagnosis, eval) linked via supports/blocks/conflicts/validates into a traversable graph, with scope layers from session-private to sealed audit-only material."
    },
