        "slc_8116b2cab9de4fbfc6fdda0001214c9bb82e6913281dd5e4607b87604937579b"
      ],
      "text": "Learning follows a governed lifecycle: evidence creates a candidate, isolated review or human decision changes its status, and regression/ablation gates publish a reproducible knowledge snapshot; rejection reasons persist so discarded patterns are not silently relearned."
    },
