      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_adc700076f4ac1f67e73f7f60297268a9542fb920efc114dfaa15ae064faca14"
      ],
      "text": "For high-risk decisions an Expert Panel reviews a frozen question through correctness, security, performance, architecture, and reproducibility lenses, debating anonymously up to three rounds before a deterministic arbiter that preserves minority opinions and fails closed to human review."
    },
